{"page_id": "realdoc_pdfs-3236abe5_docs_supply_chain_29-p1", "markdown": "# This form is approved by the Illinois Supreme Court and is required to be accepted in all Illinois Circuit Courts.\n\nSTATE OF ILLINOIS,\n\nFor Court Use Only\n\nCIRCUIT COURT\n\nPROOF OF DELIVERY\n\nCOUNTY\n\nInstructions -\n\nEnter above the county name where this case was filed.\n\nEnter the name of the person or company that filed this case as Plaintiff/Petitioner.\n\nEnter the name of the Defendant/Respondent.\n\nEnter the Case Number given by the Circuit Clerk\n\nIn 1, enter the name of the court document you are sending to the other parties in the court case (e.g., a Court Order or Answer).\n\nIn 2. enter the date you send this form to the other parties. You should send this form by 5:00 p.m. on the same day it was filed with the Circuit Clerk.\n\nIn 3, enter the full name and address of the parties or lawyers to whom you are sending a copy of this form, and check if you are sending copies of this form by hand delivery, by mail, or by email.\n\nIf a party has a lawyer, you must send a copy of this form to the lawyer.\n\nCAUTION: You may only send this form by email if the other party has agreed to receive documents in the lawsuit by email.\n\nPlaintiff / Petitioner (First, middle, last name or Company)\n\nv.\n\nDefendant / Respondent (First, middle, last name)\n\nCase Number\n\n1. I am sending the following court document:\n\n2. At or before 5:00 p.m. on: Date\n\n田\n\n20 ,-\n\n3. To:\n\nName:\n\nFirst\n\nMiddle\n\nLast\n\nAddress:\n\nStreet, Apt #\n\nCity\n\nState\n\n98101\n\nZIP\n\nEmail:\n\nBy:\n\n• Hand Delivery\n\nO Regular, First-Class Mail, deposited into the U.S. Mail with postage paid\n\n• Email\n\nName:\n\nFirst\n\nMiddle\n\nLast\n\nAddress:\n\nStreet, Apt #\n\nCity\n\nState\n\n98101\n\nZIP\n\nEmail:\n\nBy:\n\n• Hand Delivery\n\nO Regular, First-Class Mail, deposited into the U.S. Mail with postage paid\n\n• Email\n\nPD-P 803.2\n\nPage 1 of 2\n\n(11/16)", "width": 1700, "heig